    {
      "bbox": [
        161,
        354,
        1787,
        653
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "As you are aware, the Budget Director, under my orders, been carrying on a study of the assignment and use of cars in the city's motor fleet, to determine how this fleet can render the best possible service to the various city agencies at the least possible cost to the city. In line with that study, and carrying out his preliminary recommendations, it is hereby directed that:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.3891,
          "min": -1.8902
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 78,
          "mean": -0.0185,
          "min": -0.6432
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 5493,
        "area_px": 366561,
        "density": 0.01499,
        "chars": 378,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 68.81
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        161,
        680,
        1866,
        914
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "1. Use of limousine type cars is to be ended at the effective date of this order. While no cars of this type have been purchased for Heads of Agencies under the Mayor's jurisdiction for several years, the informal ruling against the purchase of such equipment is now made official.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.3002,
          "min": -1.7753
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.4287,
          "min": -0.4287
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 57,
          "mean": -0.0007,
          "min": -0.0218
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 1795,
        "area_px": 376000,
        "density": 0.00477,
        "chars": 281,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 156.55
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        161,
        958,
        1821,
        1096
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "2. The cars affected by the above shall be turned over to the Department of Purchase, for disposal, prior to the effective date of this order.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.2957,
          "min": -1.6037
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 30,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0007
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 861,
        "area_px": 216145,
        "density": 0.00398,
        "chars": 142,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 164.92
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        161,
        1141,
        1821,
        1369
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "3. Cars assigned to the Heads of Agencies shall be limited to the medium or light weight type. Agency and departmental heads are expected to make their assigned vehicles available for other official business of the department when the agency head is not using the vehicle.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1851,
          "min": -1.3717
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 50,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0021
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 2246,
        "area_px": 356095,
        "density": 0.00631,
        "chars": 272,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 121.1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        161,
        1414,
        1817,
        1821
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "4. Cars which have heretofore been assigned to city officials in the exempt category, other than heads of agencies, and cars assigned to administrative employees whose duties are not confined to field work are to be turned over immediately to a car pool or pools designated by the Director of the Budget. The need for further use of these cars and their chauffeurs in the respective car pools will be immediately examined to determine whether or not the cars should be surrendered for salvage and the positions of the assigned drivers eliminated.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1929,
          "min": -1.2903
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 101,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0017
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7048,
        "area_px": 634359,
        "density": 0.01111,
        "chars": 546,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 77.47
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        161,
        1866,
        1787,
        2010
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "5. All passenger car usage, by city employees when official city business so requires, shall be in conformance with standards to be set up by the Deputy Mayor and the Budget Director.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1742,
          "min": -1.2112
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 37,
          "mean": -0.0008,
          "min": -0.0246
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 2609,
        "area_px": 220545,
        "density": 0.01183,
        "chars": 183,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 70.14
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        161,
        2045,
        1857,
        2371
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "6. All city-owned cars shall carry the customary city seal on the door of each vehicle, but no other emblem denoting official ownership or departmental rank, except in the case of elected officials and the Police and Fire Commissioners. The above restriction shall not apply, of course, to vehicles entitled to the right of way in traffic, such as Police patrol or squad cars, or Fire Department vehicles assigned to Chiefs and others with similar duties.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2117,
          "min": -1.4504
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 88,
          "mean": -0.0015,
          "min": -0.1137
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 4966,
        "area_px": 520257,
        "density": 0.00955,
        "chars": 455,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 91.62
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        161,
        2404,
        1758,
        2582
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "7. The use of departmental, or city insignia on private cars used by departmental employees is hereafter forbidden, and the use of departmental or city insignia on any other private cars is hereafter forbidden.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2279,
          "min": -1.5727
        },
        "category": {
